{"lang":"en","name":"Update 11.21","slug":"update-14-10","category":{"lang":"en","title":"Updates","slug":"updates","important":false,"order":0},"images":{"big":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/images/Update_11_21_1920x1080.jpg__1048x590_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg","small":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/images/Update_11_21_1920x1080.jpg__168x98_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg","client":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/images/Update_11_21_1920x1080.jpg__455x256_q95_subsampling-2.jpg","medium":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/images/Update_11_21_1920x1080.jpg__392x224_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg"},"translation":{"title":"Update: Halloween Madness","description":"Enjoy the chilling atmosphere!"},"show_timer":false,"timer_start_at":null,"timer_end_at":null,"pin_page":false,"pin_weight":0,"publication_start_at":"2026-10-13T14:15:00","timer_info":null,"content":"<div><blockquote class=\"message-block\">Download the new version starting October 14!\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Chilling Atmosphere\n</h2>\n<p>The Garage takes on a gothic look. Admire the eerie glow playing across the stained glass, the haunted manor in the background, and the gargoyles keeping a wary eye on you.\n</p>\n<p>You may even spot a few mysterious figures there. NPCs might be repairing vehicles, tidying up, enjoying the view, or plotting something sinister in the shadows. Each time you enter the Garage, they may appear somewhere new, absorbed in a different task.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <gallery uuid=\"fa9846f9-f11f-4191-a5ac-9aed8b5d603d\">\n    <strong class=\"not-rendered\">folder:fa9846f9-f11f-4191-a5ac-9aed8b5d603d</strong>\n  </gallery>\n</p>\n<h2>Total Madness Mode\n</h2>\n<p>The name says it all! This new game mode brings together the best features of Blitz's various modes into one perfect mix of chaos and fun!\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Battle tanks of any tier on the same battlefield, just like in Equalizer.\n  </li>\n  <li>Unleash supernatural abilities, just like in Mad Games.\n  </li>\n  <li>Capture and hold bases that constantly change locations—all while facing an endless stream of enemies, thanks to unlimited respawns, just like in Total Domination.\n  </li>\n  <li>And experience it all in low gravity, just like in Gravity Force.\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"message-block\">Be the first to earn 1,000 victory points or obtain more victory points than the enemy team before time's up to secure your victory! Battles last 8 minutes and don't affect your stats.\n</blockquote>\n<p>Show your skills and have a blast in Total Madness from October 22 through November 2!\n</p>\n<h3>More Maps for Gravity Force and Gravitizing\n</h3>\n<p>The map pool for the low-gravity game modes has expanded by 13 maps, including:\n</p>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px 10px; vertical-align: top;\">\n  <ul>\n    <li>Canyon \n    </li>\n    <li>Faust \n    </li>\n    <li>New Bay \n    </li>\n    <li>Molendijk \n    </li>\n    <li>Vineyards\n    </li>\n    <li>Rockfield\n    </li>\n    <li>Lagoon\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 0px 10px; vertical-align: top;\">\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Alpenstadt</span>\n    </li>\n    <li>Yamato Harbor\n    </li>\n    <li>Port \n    </li>\n    <li>Hellas\n    </li>\n    <li>Wasteland\n    </li>\n    <li>Mines\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<h3>Rebalanced Mad Games and Uprising\n</h3>\n<p>More than 170 vehicles have had their battlefield roles updated in Mad Games and Uprising. This means they will receive new sets of active and passive abilities, pre-installed on each tank. For example:\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>In Mad Games, the Accelerator and Battle Coordinator abilities have been replaced with the Irradiator and Armor Regenerator abilities for the FV217 Badger.\n  </li>\n  <li>In Mad Games, the Damage Reflector and Toxic Stare abilities have been replaced with the High-Octane Fuel and Rammer Rig abilities for the E 50.\n  </li>\n  <li>In Uprising, the Dust Devil ability has been replaced with the Shadow ability for the E 100.\n  </li>\n  <li>In Uprising, the Play Dead ability has been replaced with the Battle Trance ability for the KV-3.\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Reaction Pack Screen\n</h2>\n<p>Reaction Packs have been moved from Storage to the Profile Customization screen, where your avatars and profile backgrounds are also located. To access and install your Reaction Packs, click the \"Customize profile\" button under your username.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"//media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public/images/reaction-pack-screen.jpg\">\n</p>\n<h2>Map Improvements\n</h2>\n<h3>Black Goldville\n</h3>\n<p>Black Goldville has been modernized for more enjoyable battles. Heavy tank routes to the factory and positions there are now safer, the medium tank zone encourages more active play, and tank destroyer influence has been reduced. What we've changed:\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Reworked the heavy tank direction around the factory, with more balanced and convenient approaches and reduced medium tank influence.\n  </li>\n  <li>Adjusted tank destroyer firing lines and positions around the factory, and added offensive tank destroyer positions in the center to support heavy tank attacks.\n  </li>\n  <li>Improved the cover system in the medium tank zone. The cave is now safer, with additional cover at its exit.\n  </li>\n  <li>Reduced the influence of tank destroyers in the medium tank zone by weakening several overly effective positions.\n  </li>\n  <li>Reworked the central route and spotting positions.\n  </li>\n  <li>Added depressions and adjusted the terrain geometry near point A in Supremacy.\n  </li>\n  <li>Reduced and repositioned bushes along the third line of the medium tank direction.\n  </li>\n  <li>Made a lot of small visual and terrain changes across the map to improve gameplay for different vehicle types. Improved the lighting.\n  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n  <gallery uuid=\"0014fbbe-0cab-409d-a52d-98039fdeeefe\">\n    <strong class=\"not-rendered\">folder:0014fbbe-0cab-409d-a52d-98039fdeeefe</strong>\n  </gallery>\n</p>\n<h3>Less Invisible Walls\n</h3>\n<p>To encourage new tactics and offer more freedom of movement, we've removed some invisible walls from certain maps. Updated maps include Canyon, New Bay, Molendijk, Rockfield, and more.\n</p>\n<h2>Improvements and Bug Fixes\n</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>On iOS devices, downloading the update may take a little longer than usual: we've updated the texture set, so some resources will need to be downloaded again. Everything will install automatically, so you don't need to do anything.\n  </li>\n  <li>Various screens, descriptions, and notifications have been improved.\n  </li>\n  <li>General bugs and client crash issues have been fixed.\n    <br>\n  </li>\n</ul></div>","forum_link":null,"youtube_link":"https://youtu.be/4C1t0jBcDiQ","related":[{"lang":"en","name":"Vehicle changes in Season 5 (11.3)","slug":"vehicle-changes-season-5","category":{"lang":"en","title":"Updates","slug":"updates","important":false,"order":0},"images":{"big":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/38/aa/38aabb4e-8b05-4b61-b003-448a0b499a78/vehicle-changes.jpg__1048x590_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg","small":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/38/aa/38aabb4e-8b05-4b61-b003-448a0b499a78/vehicle-changes.jpg__168x98_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg","client":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/38/aa/38aabb4e-8b05-4b61-b003-448a0b499a78/vehicle-changes.jpg__455x256_q95_subsampling-2.jpg","medium":"https://media-wbp.wgcdn.co/media/filer_public_thumbnails/filer_public/38/aa/38aabb4e-8b05-4b61-b003-448a0b499a78/vehicle-changes.jpg__392x224_q95_crop_subsampling-2.jpg"},"translation":{"title":"Balance Improvements in Season 5: Legends","description":"Old tanks, new tricks!"},"